1st feedback
As a user of the travel planning tool I want to be able to change the number of travellers that are going on the trip.
As a user of this tool I want to see an itinerary that proposes different activities each day.
As a user of the travel planning tool I want to have the possibility to choose how many children and how many adults are going on the trip.
As a user of the tool I want to have a child-friendly itinerary if I have children with me on the trip.
As a user of the tool I want to have a more specific budget choice. 
As a user of the tool I want to be able to select specific activities like a cooking class, a hike...
As a user of the tool I want the tool to suggest multiple destinations, to choose and compare your options.
As a travel agency I want the options of the countries to be more specific, I want the tool to just be around Uganda, Rwanda and Tanzania.

2nd feedback
As a user of the tool I want to be able to go to the websites of the accommodations and of the activities to have more information and/or book them.
As a user of the tool I want to see more than 1 itinerary, so that I can compare the different activities and mix and match.
As a user I want to have an option to make changes in the itinerary and to lower the total price of the trip.
As a user I want to have a better explanation of some options, e.g. What do you mean with balanced?
As a travel agency I want to see a short description of the main activity of the day and have my subactivities in the itinerary itself.
As a travel agency I want that the users of the tool see a pop-up to make an account after they have generated their itinerary.

